@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <h2 class="mb-4 text-center">About Us</h2>

    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-10 text-center">
            <p><strong>QuizMaster</strong> is an interactive quiz platform designed to challenge, entertain, and educate users of all ages. Our mission is to make learning fun and engaging through high-quality, diverse quizzes that span a wide range of topics.</p>

            <h4 class="mt-4">Our Story</h4>
            <p>Founded in 2025 by a group of tech and education enthusiasts, QuizMaster began as a passion project aimed at combining the excitement of gaming with the power of knowledge. Today, we serve a growing community of quiz lovers around the globe.</p>

            <h4 class="mt-4">What We Offer</h4>
            <p>We provide:</p>
            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                <li>✔️ Curated quizzes across multiple categories</li>
                <li>✔️ A user-friendly and responsive design</li>
                <li>✔️ Leaderboards, achievements, and more</li>
            </ul>

            <h4 class="mt-4">Our Vision</h4>
            <p>We aim to become the go-to platform for online quizzes, promoting lifelong learning and intellectual curiosity through fun and accessible content.</p>

            <h4 class="mt-4">Get In Touch</h4>
            <p>We love feedback! If you have suggestions, questions, or just want to say hi, <a href="/Home/Contact">contact us</a> anytime.</p>

            <p class="text-muted mt-4"><small>Last updated: May 15, 2025</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
